| Эпик         | Задача       | Оценка      | Дата начала  | Дата окончания  | Gantt Chart Visualization |\n|--------------|--------------|-------------|---------------|------------------|----------------------------|\n| Project A    | Task 1      | 1w 2d 4h    | 01.11.2023    | [calculated]    | [visualization]            |\n| Project B    | Task 2      | 2w 1d       | 08.11.2023    | [calculated]    | [visualization]            |\n\n## Formulas\n- Дата окончания: =WORKDAY(ДАТА_НАЧАЛА, parse_estimate(ОЦЕНКА))\n- Gantt Chart Visualization: Use conditional formatting to color cells based on task duration, excluding weekends.\n\n## Conditional Formatting\n- Weekends: Highlight with a different color.\n\n## Instructions\n1. Fill in the Эпик, Задача, and Оценка columns.\n2. The Дата окончания will automatically calculate.\n3. The Gantt Chart will visually represent task duration.